xmonad-wayland (0.2.0~dev-1) unstable; urgency=low

  * Local experimental source package; independent of upstream XMonad.
  * Require River >= 0.4 for a working session; allow a source-built compositor.
  * Build from a clean native source tree and derive ELF library dependencies.

